title: Psalm 44: Our Fathers Have Told Us
description: Psalm 44 in the King James Bible: the sons of Korah, our fathers have told us and the children asking and fathers telling of Deuteronomy 6, a communal lament in persecution, for thy sake are we killed all the day long and Romans 8, the faithful who have not forgotten God, and stand fast, from the Psalms series study.
